{"v":3,"catch":"系列中完成度最高的作品！遊樂中心征服者戰鬥機射擊STRIKERS系列第2彈！","desc":"經常去遊樂中心的人可能都聽過《STRIKERS》這個名字。\n《STRIKERS1945II》是以第二次世界大戰後為背景，透過操作6架戰鬥機中的其中一架來擊落敵機的正宗射擊遊戲。\n即使對傾瀉而下的高速彈感到憤怒，但面對無數的敵彈最後，也許會流下感動的淚水。\n想享受深度射擊的玩家、對反射神經有自信的玩家！遊玩STRIKERS1945II吧！","publisher":"ARC SYSTEM WORKS","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aea8891da3ffcae78a91a395f22055128afef5b58913f3d087190413d85ccc40.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b252bac3cd5dd208b3f64a5e2d4add57ed1d668acdd8ec2772ed48c46d3e08b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0bfc4b4d345599bf31ad8f18a5d65255356a6b656d8c8346710f653ee9c4002c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f1fdb0663f8831d61ee36f6ab2278c8ac5de53ade4128d28e23fb5e361891f9a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/131a13340678cb0842cb99ba0408b57d94ec869d5d2019640a9f78f98ffa67be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69415e5f88a2b91fb108aad037bb89aca42434daa792fb98676dcadf8cbfe544.jpg"],"titleId":"01003ea012e90000","dlc":[]}